    {
      "id": "claim_2689964bd1204431a7eced96edbe9587",
      "statement": "Gait phase is not stored in any database and is reconstructed from the foot contacts: pi per footfall, linear between footfalls, and per clip so no stride is interpolated across a boundary. A clip with fewer than two footfalls is reported as having no measurable cycle rather than being given a fabricated one, which a zero phase rate marks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
