    {
      "id": "claim_202fd6cda1724895b476a9da4b7e0425",
      "statement": "training_data deliberately builds neither network's input tensor, only the per-frame quantities underneath both, because the packing is a property of the model rather than of the database; TrainingSet.pose_vector and TrainingSet.trajectory_window offer one packing and one sampling as conveniences.",
